  "answer": "Yes. This is a known feature request, tracked in terminal#835 (tabs on the bottom, left or right, including Edge-style vertical tabs). Several other tickets were closed as duplicates of it, including terminal#10939 and terminal#11265. It isn't implemented, and the team hasn't scheduled it. The blocker is that the WinUI TabView control only supports tabs above the content. Upstream tracking is in microsoft-ui-xaml#2194. The maintainers said they would accept a contribution, either a forked TabView or a change to WinUI itself. For now, add your vote or comment on terminal#835 instead of opening a new issue. There is no setting to move the tabs."
